415
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:49,040
Vous vous apprêtez

416
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:49,500
à partir

417
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:50,600
pour un nouveau voyage.

418
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:53,900
C'était mon rêve

419
00:20:53,900 --> 00:20:55,100
d'épouser le prince Damien.

420
00:20:56,100 --> 00:20:56,580
Je sais.

421
00:20:57,540 --> 00:20:58,380
Mais je déteste

422
00:20:58,380 --> 00:20:58,720
l'idée

423
00:20:58,720 --> 00:20:59,660
de quitter ma maison.

424
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:01,580
Je comprends.

425
00:21:02,220 --> 00:21:02,420
Mais,

426
00:21:02,860 --> 00:21:03,440
