430
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:07,940
Plus que de n'importe qui,

431
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:08,520
vous comprenez.

432
00:21:09,520 --> 00:21:09,920
Alberta.

433
00:21:12,140 --> 00:21:12,540
Princesse.

434
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:25,640
Je vous souhaite

435
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:26,340
tout le bonheur

436
00:21:26,340 --> 00:21:26,800
